    "Always clear pauseDWORD and build all16384volume entries before creating DirectSound. Entry0 is literal-10000;entries1..16383 are trunc(clamp(1650*log10(i/16384),-10000,0)-200). Actual x87 FYL2X and actual CRT __ftol execute.",
