    "Clear4800bank pointers and1200counterWORDs. Set24channel IDs and24auxiliary laneWORDs to allones. Clear next-slotDWORD at79e448. Cursors,loop flags,scratch and cleanup flag79e450 remain untouched.",
    "Call DirectSoundCreate(0,&device,0),ignoring HRESULT. Any resulting nonnull device permits SetCooperativeLevel(current owner,3). Reload device after that call,then CreateSoundBuffer with exact20-byte zeroed primary descriptor: size20,flags1,other fields0.",
    "Do not clear an existing primary pointer before creation. Ignore creation HRESULT;the final real format helper decides from current nonnull device/primary pointers. Set stereo16-bit PCM at22050.",
    "Primary-format helper returns0 and leaves format untouched when either pointer is null. Otherwise capture the prior sample rate,clear exactPCMWAVEFORMAT16,write PCM tag1/channels2/rate/bytesPerSec=rate*4/block4/bits16,call SetFormat and return saved rate despite failure or callback mutation."
